ShellCrate modification to Midnight Commander 4.8.33
Modified November 15, 2026

Use the existing MC_DATADIR environment variable for shared resources as well
as configuration. ShellCrate sets it to this invocation's signed worker bundle.
This lets F1 help, hints, skins, and editor syntax work after installation or
relocation without copying bundled data into HOME. The upstream default remains
unchanged when MC_DATADIR is absent. No execution or permission logic changes.

--- a/src/main.c
+++ b/src/main.c
@@ -145,7 +145,7 @@
     else
         mc_global.sysconfig_dir = g_strdup (SYSCONFDIR);
 
-    mc_global.share_data_dir = g_strdup (DATADIR);
+    mc_global.share_data_dir = g_strdup (datadir_env != NULL ? datadir_env : DATADIR);
 }
 
